## Paper

::bg{location="hearth" time="dawn"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: There is a letter on the warm stone where she wakes. Her own handwriting. She does not remember writing it.
@wren{code="0010" mono}: "The sky is still there. Go back for it."
@maud{code="0010" emotion="guarded"}: You wrote to yourself. They all do, the ones who get out twice. Nobody knows who carries the letters down.
